Read two ASCII digits and print their product as one digit
Valid only when the product is nine or less
Tape
  cell0 first value   cell1 second value   cell2 product
Take 48 off each input then multiply then add 48 back

,------------------------------------------------>,------------------------------------------------<[>[->+>+<<]>>[-<<+>>]<<<-]>>++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++.
